{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1793018589,"nonce":"tWf31/Ye94ZXn3RJ3sxOPwVXb6U=","title":"Studio: define cross-host render and inspection resource transport","message":"Status: planned; implementation has not started.\n\nParent: ashui:d2286369fcac837cdeee0b0dd26c05ba2aa86bbd4c967e330ef1471f26a61c68\nProgram epic: ashui:d2286369fcac837cdeee0b0dd26c05ba2aa86bbd4c967e330ef1471f26a61c68\nCross-repository integration: RayDE:c299bb980e54d48d600312f31a178213d13bc56bc2d3967c4bf42ef9816d6671\nPhase: 1\n\nScope\nSpecify and implement the renderer-side contract for remote/isolated previews: versioned scene or frame records, inspection generations, fonts/glyph atlases, images, clips, embedded canvases and resource create/update/release messages. Select a transport representation from the feasibility decision; GPU handles and host pointers never cross processes. Define limits, ordering, compatibility, cancellation, backpressure and reconnect invalidation.\n\nAcceptance\nA producer and separate consumer render a representative component and its inspection snapshot. Stale or malformed messages fail the preview without corrupting the editor. Replacement, disconnect and reconnect release obsolete resources; compatibility and bounded-queue tests cover each message type.\n\nDepends on\n- RayDE:03d642c635db571275ac33007da36ac479d027a08d48d0f0a08680788c7ac2d0 — Studio: choose preview compiler, runtime and isolation contract\n- ashui:3a53c8c3514ad635f0e9dd49d38bb3103ae58b25015363b0030e756241b511ea — Studio: implement a reusable subtree renderer for CanvasKit\n- ashui:09749d70415c99561af5976b00ebbdd38844f6a9c1860e4bdaf1c728d046aa12 — Studio: expose versioned component and layout inspection data\n\nKeep implementation and validation evidence in this tracker. Follow the parent gate decisions; link any additional concrete runtime/backend prerequisite discovered by the feasibility work. No cloud deployment or new backend language is implied by this planning issue.","files":null}]}